# Scientific Reproduction v0.1 — Autonomous Development

## Development governance

- The main session is the Development Supervisor.
- M0-M13 are Milestones; implement only through frozen atomic DEV-GOAL contracts.
- `.development/` is the development Single Source of Truth. Claude Code task state is a mirror only.
- The Supervisor delegates product implementation to workers and independently verifies all work.
- Workers may not edit frozen development acceptance criteria or locked product architecture.
- Continue automatically until all M0-M13 and release gates pass unless a formal Development Human Gate blocks all progress.

## Summary preservation

When compacting/summarizing, preserve:

- current Development Plan version;
- M0-M13 status;
- ready/assigned/rejected DEV-GOAL IDs;
- frozen acceptance criteria for active goals;
- worker/session identities and worktrees;
- latest test failures and Supervisor review decisions;
- blocking gates;
- locked architecture decisions relevant to current work.
